<title>UK: Sweden sets A$100 million 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets A$100 million 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KINGDOM OF SWEDEN</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.875     MATURITY    23.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.98     PAY DATE    23.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA+   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
